==================================================================
 증거자료 : ⑧ crontab 매분 실행 등록 및 자동 실행 확인
 일시     : 2026-09-17 14:52:01 KST
 호스트   : agent
 OS       : Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS / aarch64
 실행계정 : tokomon
==================================================================

※ cron 실행 계정: agent-admin (agent-core 소속이므로 agent-dev 소유 monitor.sh 를 그룹 권한 r-x 로 실행 가능)

$ sudo crontab -u agent-admin -l
------------------------------------------------------------------
   # B4-1 시스템 관제 — monitor.sh 매분 실행 (실행 계정: agent-admin)
   * * * * * /home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh >> /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out 2>&1
   [exit=0]

$ systemctl is-active cron
------------------------------------------------------------------
   active
   [exit=0]

※ [자동 누적 검증] 기준선 기록 -> 75초 무개입 대기 -> 재측정

$ date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'; sudo wc -l /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
------------------------------------------------------------------
   2026-09-17 14:52:01
   31 /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
   [exit=0]

$ sudo tail -2 /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
------------------------------------------------------------------
   [2026-09-17 14:50:02] PID:5454 CPU:0.0% MEM:7.0% DISK_USED:1%
   [2026-09-17 14:51:02] PID:5454 CPU:0.6% MEM:9.3% DISK_USED:1%
   [exit=0]

※ --- 75초 경과 (사람의 개입 없음) ---

$ date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'; sudo wc -l /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
------------------------------------------------------------------
   2026-09-17 14:53:16
   33 /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
   [exit=0]

$ sudo tail -3 /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
------------------------------------------------------------------
   [2026-09-17 14:51:02] PID:5454 CPU:0.6% MEM:9.3% DISK_USED:1%
   [2026-09-17 14:52:02] PID:5454 CPU:1.3% MEM:8.1% DISK_USED:1%
   [2026-09-17 14:53:02] PID:5454 CPU:0.6% MEM:8.9% DISK_USED:1%
   [exit=0]

※ 라인 수가 증가하고 타임스탬프가 매분 00~10초 대에 찍혀 있다면 cron 자동 실행이 정상 동작하는 것.

$ sudo grep CRON /var/log/syslog | grep agent-admin | tail -5
------------------------------------------------------------------
   Sep 17 14:49:01 agent CRON[6118]: (agent-admin) CMD (/home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh >> /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out 2>&1)
   Sep 17 14:50:01 agent CRON[6248]: (agent-admin) CMD (/home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh >> /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out 2>&1)
   Sep 17 14:51:01 agent CRON[6282]: (agent-admin) CMD (/home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh >> /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out 2>&1)
   Sep 17 14:52:01 agent CRON[6307]: (agent-admin) CMD (/home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh >> /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out 2>&1)
   Sep 17 14:53:01 agent CRON[6370]: (agent-admin) CMD (/home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh >> /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out 2>&1)
   [exit=0]

$ sudo tail -5 /var/log/agent-app/monitor-cron.out
------------------------------------------------------------------
   DISK Used  : 1%
   
   [OK] All resource usage within thresholds.
   
   [INFO] Log appended: /var/log/agent-app/monitor.log
   [exit=0]

※ monitor-cron.out 은 cron 이 실행한 monitor.sh 의 표준출력/에러를 모은 파일.

